{"seq":17,"trial_id":"v02-heldout-2026-10/openclaw-sonnet-gbrain-told-mu-v02-heldout/ms-06-phl-tickets/r4","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T02:25:07.654Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"67f0c5ab9b43f909dc17bba94fa94445f0d2f64c71be72c894e6783b738b1d56","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","text":"Bettina, I checked #coastal-team and #coastal-random, Moss's Coastal digests and your Pellucid cutover note. Neither channel mentions a ticket or feature request for either account. Everything below comes from the notes.\n\n**Pellucid Harbor Logistics (PHL)**\n- **#4419:** the `Yard_Dwell_Summary` report times out when filtered by container length. Moss's Coastal cheat sheet lists it as open. The ticket number needs checking, because see the Driftmoor section.\n- **PD-8841:** Pemberline Dock handling of chassis pool holds on double-booked gates, Gate 4B. This is from your 12/8 cutover recap.\n- **Berth 2 yard map CSV import bug:** also from your recap. It has no ticket number.\n- The cheat sheet also notes chassis pool validation at Gate 4 during shift change as the main friction point. It gives no ticket number.\n\n**Driftmoor Marine Freight (DMF)**\n- **Feature request #882:** warehouse managers want a bulk-clear button for departed barges. This is from the cheat sheet.\n- **#4419 (conflict):** Moss's 11/2 digest ties #4419 to barge slip 7 schedule sync on Kwame's port account, where DMF asked for a patched manifest CSV before the 06:00 shift. The cheat sheet ties #4419 to PHL's report timeout. One of the two notes has the number wrong, or the number was reused. Kwame should confirm before it goes in the review.\n- **Tide-table import macro failure on Terminal B:** engineering gave the night dispatcher a manual CSV patch. It has no ticket number.\n\n**Left out**\n- Pellow Home Living (formerly Covey & Lark Retail): PD-4821 and #8812.\n- Saltmarsh Provisions: PD-4824 and PD-4827.\n\nI only found notes dated through May 2026, so anything newer on these accounts wouldn't show up here. I can't see account ticket files or channels you're not in."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","ts":"1791986400.000124"}}
